  "determination": true,
  "rationale": "`assets/skills/habeas/SKILL.md` is a bundled skill with front matter, so it is a site of `requirements.cli.skill_conventions.next`.\n\nThe skill's `## Workflow` section is a routing workflow. Its first step is a table that names the skill for each kind of task:\n- `habeas-requirements`\n- `habeas-refactor`\n- `habeas-evidence`\n- `habeas-bootstrap-requirements`\n\nThe requirement allows a skill to name a skill for each outcome when different outcomes lead to different tasks. The table does that.\n\nStep 2 closes the workflow with \"Follow that skill; each one names the next.\" It also names the order when a change both moves and edits: `habeas-refactor` first, then the skill the table gives for the edit.\n\nThe workflow therefore ends by sending the reader to a bundled skill for each outcome. An outcome with no further task needs no skill named.\n\nNo obligation is left unmet. No violation matches were listed for this site. The step 2 wording could be tighter, but the text does not require the skills to be repeated in the final bullet.",
